@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5001/api/v1
### Use an accessToken from your existing administrative login environment.
### Read management list (Admin/Super Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/support/admin/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}
x-rest-client-auth: primary
X-Login-Area: admin

### Read a draft and its expectedVersion
GET {{baseUrl}}/support/admin/documents/privacy
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}
x-rest-client-auth: primary
X-Login-Area: admin

### Save draft. Replace expectedVersion with the reviewed __v from GET.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/support/admin/documents/privacy
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN}}
x-rest-client-auth: primary
X-Login-Area: admin
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "<p>Nội dung cần được rà soát trước khi công bố.</p>", "publish": false, "expectedVersion": 0 }

### Read the published article without recording a view
GET {{baseUrl}}/support/documents/privacy

### Record one successful public navigation
POST {{baseUrl}}/support/documents/privacy/views
